  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.66666668653488 cup confectioners' sugar",
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "3 cups white sugar",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "4 eggs, beaten",
    "4.5 cups chopped fresh rhubarb"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fnFxlQyOyR3_eUSlvmtx5lqE2mo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87377-rhubarb-dream-bars-ddmfs-01-17657-d1403da33a2d4d2fa8b0435dc9f235b2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87377/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Mix 2 cups of flour, confectioners' sugar, and butter together in a medium bowl until it forms a dough, or at least the butter is in small crumbs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hWaaT0HOMliUg2-eFYknL5scLYg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87377-rhubarb-dream-bars-ddmfs-02-17659-513198ac08474076bc7dfd302ec85182.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87377/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press into the bottom of a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/olWVCSLF8kTErtINQJ-qpY7NAy4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87377-rhubarb-dream-bars-ddmfs-03-17661-087bd7d831914db397e89e97f1757820.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87377/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 10 minutes in the preheated oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BQtXuaiCJ3TVKXfEFa8hUsUJ8Rk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87377-rhubarb-dream-bars-ddmfs-04-17672-6bcb59396a1e4764a84418b32d1e5064.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87377/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, whisk white sugar, salt, flour, and eggs together in a large bowl; stir in rhubarb to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-r-U1Y4zFuXRru0lLSb6exe25Fk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87377-rhubarb-dream-bars-ddmfs-05-17673-2cff615342844dd88a68f0c24c37833a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87377/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread evenly over the baked crust when it comes out of the oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e-JhW8sS9rQg2upywBpH5L2XjO8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87377-rhubarb-dream-bars-ddmfs-06-17676-7d8591668d8a4358b2d920f836147efe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87377/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for another 35 minutes in the preheated oven, or until rhubarb is tender. Cool and cut into squares to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m-KkOXCnrxZLr8cCFFTIhM7LXfc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87377-rhubarb-dream-bars-ddmfs-08-17743-503df94fafca4bff982ad0107d44cf77.jpg"
